<title>LATVIA: LATVIAN TRASTA BANK FIVE-MO PROFIT 622,727 LATS.</title>
<headline>LATVIAN TRASTA BANK FIVE-MO PROFIT 622,727 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia's Trasta Bank on Friday said its profit in the first five months of the year was 622,727 lats, of which 80,127 lats was earned in May.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that most of the income came from security operations and fees for services.</p>
<p>The bank's assets rose by 4.7 million lats to 25.71 million lats, the largest asset rise this year.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
